{"3682580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TechWorld", "steam_appid": 3682580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TechWorld</strong> combines tower defence, action combat, and roguelike progression into a fast-paced strategic experience. Build your base of automated towers, fight alongside them in real-time battles, and adapt your tactics as enemy waves grow stronger. Every run offers new upgrades, challenges, and rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat and Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade automated defences, then fight alongside your towers in real-time combat. Collect gears, survive escalating waves of enemies, and unlock new maps, abilities, and upgrades as you progress through each challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682580/extras/f01289eab8410c6507e12249973e1314.poster.avif?t=1773719643\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682580/extras/f01289eab8410c6507e12249973e1314.webm?t=1773719643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682580/extras/f01289eab8410c6507e12249973e1314.mp4?t=1773719643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades and Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you receive a selection of upgrade cards that offer unique stat boosts and abilities in roguelike fashion. Earn cash and gears from defeated enemies to improve your towers and equipment. At the end of each mission, gain Techpoints and crates containing valuable rewards. Once you have gathered enough Techpoints, convert them into Ascendpoints to unlock powerful permanent upgrades that redefine your robot’s potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682580/extras/e6d9b7a2015da0a232285b70c06dca40.poster.avif?t=1773719643\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682580/extras/e6d9b7a2015da0a232285b70c06dca40.webm?t=1773719643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682580/extras/e6d9b7a2015da0a232285b70c06dca40.mp4?t=1773719643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tech Tree, Inventory, and Map Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Tech Tree to unlock new upgrades, abilities, and tower enhancements that suit your preferred playstyle. Use your earned Techpoints and Ascendpoints to progress through different branches and create unique build paths for your robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory to open crates earned from mission completion, containing rare equipment and special abilities that boost your combat efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your experience by adjusting map difficulty, enemy speed, and health for greater rewards. Higher settings offer increased challenge and better loot drops, perfect for players seeking tougher battles and faster progression. Advance through missions to unlock new maps and environments, each featuring stronger enemies and valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682580/extras/b9366203202e9a970e85cea912c481d8.poster.avif?t=1773719643\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse